'''Chinchou''' (Japanese: '''チョンチー''' ''Chonchie'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

